<pre class=metadata>
Title: Network Media Queries
Shortname: network-media-queries
Level: none
Status: LD
ED: https://arronei.github.io/CSS-Additions/system-media-queries/network/spec/
Repository: arronei/CSS-Additions
Editor: Arron Eicholz
Abstract: This specification adds two media features about the user's network. '@media/network' reports
    whether the user agent is online, exactly as <code>navigator.onLine</code> does, so a style sheet can
    dim controls that need a connection. '@media/connection' reports whether the network the user is on is
    metered, as operating systems report for cellular data, hotspots, and Low Data Mode, so pages can avoid
    large downloads. Neither reveals the kind of network, its speed, or its name, and changes to
    '@media/connection' are delivered late so that they can't link the user's visits to different sites.
Markup Shorthands: markdown yes, css yes
Complain About: accidental-2119 no, missing-example-ids yes
Assume Explicit For: yes
</pre>

